        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "¿Cuál es la palabra n.º %d?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Who are you?" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wer bist du?"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "¿Quién eres?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With KENNI, you and the people you trust exchange personal keys — ideally face to face, with a quick QR scan. No accounts, no passwords." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mit KENNI tauschst du persönliche Schlüssel mit Menschen aus, denen du vertraust – am besten von Angesicht zu Angesicht per QR-Scan. Keine Konten, keine Passwörter."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Con KENNI intercambias claves personales con las personas de tu confianza — idealmente cara a cara, con un rápido escaneo QR. Sin cuentas ni contraseñas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without iCloud, your written recovery phrase is the only way back into your identity." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ohne iCloud ist deine notierte Wiederherstellungsphrase der einzige Weg zurück zu deiner Identität."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sin iCloud, tu frase de recuperación escrita es el único camino de vuelta a tu identidad."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Works completely without internet — on both phones." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Funktioniert komplett ohne Internet – auf beiden Handys."
